Use "epl-cloud"

Note: Configure AWS region (credentials come from environment)
Call configure("us-east-1", "", "")

Note: Create a bucket
result = create_bucket("my-epl-demo-bucket")
Say result

Note: Write text directly to S3
Call write_text("my-epl-demo-bucket", "hello.txt", "Hello from EPL Cloud!")

Note: Read it back
content = read_text("my-epl-demo-bucket", "hello.txt")
Say "File content: " + content

Note: Check if it exists
found = exists("my-epl-demo-bucket", "hello.txt")
Say "Exists: " + to_text(found)

Note: List all objects in the bucket
files = list_objects("my-epl-demo-bucket", "")
For Each item in files
    Say item
End

Note: Clean up — delete the object
Call delete_object("my-epl-demo-bucket", "hello.txt")
Say "Deleted hello.txt"
